  "name": "DaMuSc measured scales",
  "attribution": "DaMuSc: Database of Musical Scales. Database compilation, annotations and metadata © 2022–2026 John M. McBride and contributors. CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ . Source: https://github.com/jomimc/DaMuSc/tree/9a4589b99d229691fbefd99b4174e39814789a16. McBride JM, Passmore S, Tlusty T (2023), Convergent evolution in a large cross-cultural database of musical scales, PLoS ONE 18(12): e0284851, https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0284851 . Selected 424 measured records from M0001–M0434, excluding M0013, M0017, M0018, M0022, M0024, M0028, M0029, M0030, M0031 and M0037. Thor Tracker summed adjacent intervals into cumulative cents without rounding; appended 1200 cents only for Octave_modified=Y; preserved other periods. Fresh labels and region categories from licensed metadata; no deduplication, normalization or variants. Per-entry credits identify original sources and changes. No underlying publications, evidence images or audio included; no endorsement implied. Supplied without warranties. Full licence and upstream statement accompany this pack in LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.txt and DaMuSc-LICENSE.txt.",
